{"unit_id":"wqx-txdsyl__dsh-ds-attach#card-zh","repo":"wqx-txdsyl/dsh-ds-attach","commit":"7b11a471e731253b74d6f41a34e15dabaa715244","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ds-attach 是面向 DSH Web 的文档附件插件。它在输入框加入上传按钮和拖放上传，并在服务端保存文件、提取文档文本后注入消息；PDF、DOCX、XLSX、PPTX、ODF、RTF 和常见文本格式有对应解析逻辑，扫描版 PDF 可选用视觉 OCR。输入区展示文件卡片和处理状态，对话记录中也能以卡片查看附件内容，图片则沿用 DSH 原生视觉附件管线。适合需要把本地文档内容交给 DSH 对话处理的用户；OCR 需配置兼容的 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:710-755","lib/index.js:375-423"]}
{"unit_id":"wqx-txdsyl__dsh-ds-attach#card-en","repo":"wqx-txdsyl/dsh-ds-attach","commit":"7b11a471e731253b74d6f41a34e15dabaa715244","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ds-attach adds file uploads to DSH Web. It stores attachments, extracts text from documents, and adds it to messages. Optional vision OCR reads scanned PDFs. Cards show upload status and expandable transcript content; images use DSH’s native attachment path. OCR needs an API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:710-755","lib/index.js:375-423"]}
