{"unit_id":"wqx-txdsyl__dsh-ds-attach#feature-1","repo":"wqx-txdsyl/dsh-ds-attach","commit":"7b11a471e731253b74d6f41a34e15dabaa715244","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ds-attach 的功能「upload」：支持在输入框选择多个文件，也可拖放非图片文件上传；处理中的卡片显示上传与解析状态，图片交给 DSH 原生视觉附件管线。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:147-164"]}
{"unit_id":"wqx-txdsyl__dsh-ds-attach#feature-2","repo":"wqx-txdsyl/dsh-ds-attach","commit":"7b11a471e731253b74d6f41a34e15dabaa715244","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ds-attach 的功能「extract」：服务端可提取 PDF、DOCX、XLSX、PPTX、ODF、RTF 和多种文本格式内容，并将结果附加到待发送消息；文本长度可配置上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:375-423"]}
{"unit_id":"wqx-txdsyl__dsh-ds-attach#feature-3","repo":"wqx-txdsyl/dsh-ds-attach","commit":"7b11a471e731253b74d6f41a34e15dabaa715244","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ds-attach 的功能「ocr」：遇到没有文字层的扫描版 PDF 时，可渲染页面并调用配置的视觉模型识别文字；文字层优先，也可通过设置强制或禁用 OCR。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-150"]}
{"unit_id":"wqx-txdsyl__dsh-ds-attach#feature-4","repo":"wqx-txdsyl/dsh-ds-attach","commit":"7b11a471e731253b74d6f41a34e15dabaa715244","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ds-attach 的功能「cards」：输入区以文件卡片显示附件状态；发送后，对话记录解析结构化附件标记并呈现可展开的内容卡片。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:375-405"]}
{"unit_id":"wqx-txdsyl__dsh-ds-attach#caveat-1","repo":"wqx-txdsyl/dsh-ds-attach","commit":"7b11a471e731253b74d6f41a34e15dabaa715244","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ds-attach 使用视觉 OCR 时，会把扫描 PDF 页面图像发送到配置的 OpenAI 兼容 OCR 服务；未设置 OCR 密钥时不会执行该识别请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:201-224","lib/index.js:234-240"]}
